{"id":"8ecc018639c40052","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-black-tree.md","title":"e-黑树引理","display":"lem-black-tree — e-黑树引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-black-tree","aliases":["20-lem-black-tree"],"display":"lem-black-tree — e-黑树引理","chapter":"12","section":"12.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Lemma 12.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[229],"source_printed_pages":[199],"depends_on":["[[20-df-on-function-tree]]","[[20-df-e-splitting]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-black-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-black-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-black-tree — e-黑树引理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 12.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>199</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\Phi_e^A\">\\(g=\\Phi_e^A\\)</span> 全定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\ng\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\ng\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(x)\">\\(g(x)\\)</span> 时枚举值域，找到任何节点上第 x 个计算停止的输出。这样的节点存在，因为 A 的实际计算有有限 use；若输出与 A 不同，会形成 e-分裂，违背黑性。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 12.2.2；印刷页 199；PDF 第 229 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-on-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{On}(A,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\Phi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\ng\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}.","display":true},{"tex":"g(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1300,"backlinks":[{"id":"42322b2e4562a7f4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-lem-black-tree]]；see [[20-lem-white-tree]]；see [[20-lem-posner-epstein]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-black-tree]] — 章 12；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-black-tree]]"}],"outgoing":["37dcefa1c874faab","5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","e343870c773cb68e"]}